//! Moonwell's cbETH market on Base, priced through Dimension.
//!
//! `registry` declares the two Chainlink feeds the market needs, once each and
//! with the pair each prices. `pricing` composes them into the cbETH/USD price
//! the market values collateral at, and `contracts` deploys that price. On
//! 2026-02-15 MIP-X43 gave the market the cbETH/ETH exchange rate as its USD
//! feed, and for eight days Moonwell priced cbETH at about 1.12 USD. Written
//! against this registry, that configuration does not compile.
